# cad-lib

Parametric CAD parts built with `build123d`.

Create a local environment and install the project in editable mode:

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
.venv/bin/python -m pip install --upgrade pip
.venv/bin/python -m pip install -e .
```

Run the geometry tests with `.venv/bin/python -m pytest`. Execute
`parts/example_bracket.py` from the repository root to generate STEP and STL
files in `exports/`.
